; ==============================================================================
;  config\hotkeys.rc  -  hotkeys and desktop clicks shared by the themes.
;  A theme that wants another desktop click defines DesktopRightClick/MiddleClick
;  before including this file (the first definition wins); hotkeys only add.
;  Owned by the repo: deploy and the installer overwrite it.
; ==============================================================================
DesktopRightClick !PopupContext
DesktopMiddleClick !PopupStartMenu
*HotKey CTRLALT F12 !PopupStartMenu
*HotKey WIN X       !PopupContext
*HotKey CTRLALT R   !Recycle
